  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Renforcement de la r&#xE9;silience par les moyens de subsistances des d&#xE9;plac&#xE9;s &#xE0; l&#x2019;int&#xE9;rieur et ext&#xE9;rieur des camps au Nord Kivu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide 39,000 displaced people, both inside and outside displacement camps, with emergency livelihood assistance to improve their resilience. This FAO project will assist targeted people with innovative food production emergency solutions by providing seeds and agricultural tools in conjunction with a one-off cash transfer. This project will be implemented in close coordination with WFP. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 39,000 people, including 14,400 women, 2,800 children, and including 7,000 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
